<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The world, we cannot overcome!</l><l>But our spirit, is powerful! Strong!</l><l>We exercise, call His name, breathe Him in!</l><l>The world then has no chance to win!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The self and the flesh have to go!</l><l>My natural ability too!</l><l>All independence, division must flee,</l><l>The work of the Spirit frees me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
